# Reviewed ideas: status

| Idea | Status | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Static `live.json` instead of polling Apps Script | Implemented | `apps-script/Live.gs` publishes to GitHub. Phones poll the static file and fall back to the API. |
| Lock public writes | Implemented | `PUBLIC_WRITE_ACTIONS` + `withLock_` in `Code.gs` |
| Guest/pass caching | Implemented | Versioned CacheService keys, invalidated on writes, and capped at the next reveal unlock |
| Bride vs Groom team battle | Done (extended) | Check-in points (`points.checkIn`) and on-time bonus (`points.onTime`) were added. |
| EXIF auto-sort uploads into events | Implemented | `App.takenAt` + `eventForTime_` (client and server) |
| Base64 upload size trap | Not applicable | Uploads already use Drive resumable sessions directly from the browser. |
| Large-file fallback | Implemented | Shows a warning plus a `media.largeAlbumUrl` link. |
| Elder Mode | Implemented | A+ toggle, large text, essentials only, help call button |
| Offline pass at the gate | Implemented | Last pass is saved in localStorage. |
| Serif memorial typography | Implemented | `css/memorial.css` |
| Accessibility (touch targets, focus, reduced motion) | Implemented | `css/mobile.css` |
| Printable memory book | Implemented | Admin → Memorial → Memory book (browser print to PDF keeps Devanagari intact). |
| Health monitoring | Implemented | `apps-script/Health.gs` hourly email |
| React / Tailwind / shadcn prompts | Not applicable | The app is vanilla HTML/JS with no build step. |
| gviz CSV reads from the Sheet | Not applicable | It requires a public sheet and would expose guest data. |
| wsrv.nl image proxy | Optional | Drive thumbnails plus service-worker caching are enough for now. |
| Full EXIF library | Future | The current parser is heuristic; fall back to `lastModified`. |
